 Stitt (R) is not on the ballot."]}, "overview": "Oklahoma's open governor's race pits Republican Mike Mazzei against Democratic state Representative Cyndi Munson, with several independents also on the ballot. The state's strong Republican lean gives Mazzei a clear edge, and expert raters uniformly place the contest in the Likely or Solid Republican column. Prediction markets put Democratic chances near one in ten.\n\nStill, the race has drawn more attention than most Oklahoma contests. A Democratic-sponsored poll shows a single-digit margin, national Democrats have pledged about half a million dollars to help Munson, and both candidates are campaigning on teacher pay and policy contrasts. Munson's campaign points to momentum, while a state pollster's revised analysis suggests the tighter numbers may not hold. The forecast expects a Republican win by high single digits, with enough uncertainty that a closer contest cannot be ruled out.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0232, "margin": -13.12}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0251, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0363, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0381, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.035, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0321, "margin": -13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0186, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.018, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0192, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0194, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0356, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0365, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0342, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0558, "margin": -11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0353, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0312, "margin": -12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0348, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.03, "margin": -12